14. IDEMPOTENCY TESTING
Mutating requests supporting:
Idempotency-Key
shall be tested by submitting the same request multiple times.
Expected behavior:
REQUEST 1
 ↓
EXECUTE

REQUEST 2
 ↓
RECOGNIZE DUPLICATE
 ↓
RETURN ORIGINAL RESULT
No duplicate project mutation shall occur.

15. CONCURRENCY TESTING
OneDraft shall test concurrent operations against the same project.
Examples:
two simultaneous revisions
two Aria commands
simultaneous redline updates
drawing generation during model modification
validation during revision creation
The system shall prevent stale state from becoming authoritative.

16. OPTIMISTIC CONCURRENCY TESTING
Commands containing:
expected_revision
shall fail when the expected revision is no longer current.
Example:
CLIENT
expects Revision 14

SERVER
currently Revision 15

RESULT
CONFLICT
The test shall confirm that the command does not modify the project.

